        <https://w3id.org/ecoweaver/warp/AcquisitionMethodEnum#expert_elicitation>,
        <https://w3id.org/ecoweaver/warp/AcquisitionMethodEnum#field_survey>,
        <https://w3id.org/ecoweaver/warp/AcquisitionMethodEnum#in_situ_sensor>,
        <https://w3id.org/ecoweaver/warp/AcquisitionMethodEnum#laboratory_assay>,
