    owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/ecoweaver/warp/FeatureAssertionEnum#explicitly_asserted> <https://w3id.org/ecoweaver/warp/FeatureAssertionEnum#implicitly_assumed> <https://w3id.org/ecoweaver/warp/FeatureAssertionEnum#explicitly_denied> <https://w3id.org/ecoweaver/warp/FeatureAssertionEnum#not_addressed> ) ;
